flowchart LR
    A[Admin Configuration<br/>Onboarding / Products / Commission / Deals] --> B[Franchisee App<br/>Order + Fulfillment Choice]
    B --> C[Outlet POS (Multi User)<br/>Floor Scan + Bill + Individual Packing]
    C --> D[Delivery Guard<br/>Receives Bill or Docket + Captures Weight]

    D --> E[Option A: Franchise Pickup]
    D --> F[Option B: Delivery Man]

    E --> G[Franchise Collects<br/>OTP Confirmation]
    F --> H[Delivery Man Pickup From Guard]
    H --> I[Delivered To Franchise<br/>POD Confirmation]

    C --> J[Multi-Bill Logic]
    J --> K[Each Bill Packed Individually]
    K --> L[Bundle Under Single Docket]
    L --> D
    D --> M{Weight Within Tolerance?}
    M -->|Yes| E
    M -->|Yes| F
    M -->|No| N[Alert: Recheck Qty/Items]
    N --> C
